before:
Complete local Java example; the app itself does not execute it:
```java
class Trace implements AutoCloseable {
    Trace() { System.out.println("open"); }
    void work() { System.out.println("body"); }
    @Override
    public void close() { System.out.println("close"); }
}
public class Main {
    static void run(boolean early) {
        try (Trace trace = new Trace()) {
            trace.work();
            if (early) return;
        }
        System.out.println("after");
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) { run(false); }
}

```

